          "quote": "Platform Default control size Minimum control size iOS, iPadOS 44x44 pt 28x28 pt macOS 28x28 pt 20x20 pt tvOS 66x66 pt 56x56 pt visionOS 60x60 pt 28x28 pt watchOS 44x44 pt 28x28 pt",
